  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study on HRBA (DIHR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grants supports a study on existing experiences with the human rights-based approach (HRBA) carried out by the Danish Institute for Human Rights. The study will secure that the tools &#xbf; developed by Danida in connection with the rolling out of the HRBA &#xbf; is based on international good practice. Hereby, the study will contribute to the necessary and relevant capacity building concerning HRBA in Danida.</narrative>
  </description>
